{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chronicles of Nesis Demo brings together some of the best elements of the fifth-generation RPGs including: pre-rendered graphics, tactical combat, visible enemy encounters, seamless battle transitions, and configurable and class skills. Join Elias, an unassuming windmill mechanic, as he discovers the dangers lurking beneath his own sleepy village and the history of the Anam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chronicles of Nesis Demo represents years of work from a solo dev. It is an attempt to capture the seemingly lost artistic execution of the highly praised video games of the 1990s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/d1160be5389b60b12cf35b05ed35782d.avif?t=1754594468\" width=974 height=86 /></span>Reviving the lost art styles of the 1990 JRPGs through pre-rendered backgrounds, perspective projection, and traditional pixel art sprites.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/61effad3f9787f0126944312564c85a7.avif?t=1754594468\" width=912 height=738 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/40f95e01d50fb321c2b0d76ab489c998.avif?t=1754594468\" width=972 height=86 /></span>Get the best of both tactical turn-based combat and world exploration. Combat seamlessly transitions between exploration and tactical combat overlay, letting you jump right into and out of combat. Consider when and how you engage enemies or possibly avoid combat altogether. But be careful, some enemies might appear when you least expect it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/5058191bbf97f05337323ac139619c23.poster.avif?t=1754594468\" width=1326 height=904 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/5058191bbf97f05337323ac139619c23.webm?t=1754594468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/5058191bbf97f05337323ac139619c23.mp4?t=1754594468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/81a7c7c07190676d047b7b241c1d3b7f.avif?t=1754594468\" width=976 height=84 /></span>Skills can be learned by progressing your class's skill tree, which are custom to your class, or by finding Relics. Relics may be equipped according to relic slots found in equipment. Both class skills and relic skills increase in Proficiency upon use in combat unlocking powerful improvements.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/3bbd4a92b46965b04948d49b8e4ee2d9.avif?t=1754594468\" width=1068 height=716 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 - 5 hours of play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters; enemies can be seen running around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 3 skill tree paths across the Paladin skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out up to 4 Relics augmenting in-combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village of Laria and the slime infested cavernous waterways underneath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-rendered 