s can be learned by progressing your class's skill tree, which are custom to your class, or by finding Relics. Relics may be equipped according to relic slots found in equipment. Both class skills and relic skills increase in Proficiency upon use in combat unlocking powerful improvements.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/extras/3bbd4a92b46965b04948d49b8e4ee2d9.avif?t=1754594468\" width=1068 height=716 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 - 5 hours of play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No random encounters; enemies can be seen running around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 3 skill tree paths across the Paladin skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out up to 4 Relics augmenting in-combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the village of Laria and the slime infested cavernous waterways underneath</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pre-rendered backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music inspired by  RPG classics</p></li></ul>","developers":["AllByte"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3900010","name":"The Chronicles of Nesis"},"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917630/f634bb6a8f9458bf447f4b53241c09e55fdbce2e/header.jpg?t=1754594468","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175469,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175469/movie480.mp4?t=1754594466","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175469/movie_max.mp4?t=1754594466"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175469/5a95cd833eabcc12dc4392316c35ba0dbff1203e/movie_